<span class="line"><span style="color:#A6ACCD;">npm ERR</span><span style="color:#89DDFF;">!</span><span style="color:#A6ACCD;"> </span><span style="color:#F78C6C;">404</span><span style="color:#A6ACCD;"> You should bug the author to publish </span><span style="color:#82AAFF;">it</span><span style="color:#A6ACCD;"> (or use the name yourself</span><span style="color:#89DDFF;">!</span><span style="color:#A6ACCD;">)</span></span>
